== Projects ==
=== VPM Manager ===
The VPM ecosystem is decentralized by design: anyone can publish a listing. In practice that means a pile of repository URLs to maintain, transitive dependencies and removals nobody can follow, and paid assets travelling as loose <code>.unitypackage</code> files.

[https://vpmm.dev VPM Manager] is my answer. One license-respecting catalog that aggregates public listings, free and paid, and mirrors the archives so a package survives its original host. Searchable from inside [[VRChat Creator Companion|VCC]] or [[Community:ALCOM|ALCOM]], with richer metadata on the site itself, dependency graphs included. My own listing domain <code>vpm.hackebein.dev</code> points at it and generates my listing page on its own.

Publishing side is [https://github.com/Hackebein/hackebein.vpm.packager hackebein.vpm.packager], the Unity editor tool I package my own releases with.

