=== Bug hunting and quality assurance ===
I file bug reports and break things before you do. Not a hobby, it just happens when I touch software. I am part of the Community Testers program described on [[Quality Assurance]]. Next up is a GitHub runner driving one VR and three desktop clients at once, so world and avatar tests crash on a schedule instead of at random.

