=== Your World ===
Your own persistent world without ever opening Unity. Built collaboratively, then decorated with photos, videos and holograms from wherever you have already been. Some unlocks tie back into Citizen of VRChat.

=== VRCRecords ===
Automated capture of instances and events in 4K at 30FPS, with camera movement instead of a headset on a tripod. Live out via Spout, NDI and RTSP, which makes it usable for streaming or VJ visuals. Self-hosting and a proper video and movie production path are on the list.

